        <mxCell id="note" value="Data flow: Bench —47100→ V2X ECU —47200→ ADA ECU —47300→ IVI ECU. Each ECU sends only to its own gateway.&lt;br&gt;Lines show pin membership, not direction: every edge is pin OUTPUT → hub INPUT. A bridge is an L2 switch and never routes.&lt;br&gt;The KUKSA Databroker is the only path between the four bridges." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="410" width="870" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
